    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>SYSTEMCRASH92</strong>, an exciting survival crafting game with RPG elements that captures the essence of classic arcade games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/0c45d1b9efe0de7c739915fc721e5533.avif?t=1743815931\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore portals filled with enemies of varying levels while gathering minerals to craft new weapons. Each portal presents a unique challenge, culminating in epic boss battles. The more you play, the stronger you become: level up, improve your skills, and dominate a world full of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/22aac0878e557043d2d4ee8f00c54977.avif?t=1743815931\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/501077fbf83ca031d31d88e2a1b640fa.poster.avif?t=1743815931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/501077fbf83ca031d31d88e2a1b640fa.webm?t=1743815931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/501077fbf83ca031d31d88e2a1b640fa.mp4?t=1743815931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fans of <strong>leveling</strong>, <strong>crafting</strong>, and screen-shaking attacks, <strong>SYSTEMCRASH92</strong> combines fast-paced gameplay with a fun style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/3be6bc2b92222bb4b86868ca280c0187.poster.avif?t=1743815931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/3be6bc2b92222bb4b86868ca280c0187.webm?t=1743815931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/3be6bc2b92222bb4b86868ca280c0187.mp4?t=1743815931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for action? Dare to clear the portals and prove your power!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>SYSTEMCRASH92</strong>, an exciting survival crafting game with RPG elements that captures the essence of classic arcade games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/0c45d1b9efe0de7c739915fc721e5533.avif?t=1743815931\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore portals filled with enemies of varying levels while gathering minerals to craft new weapons. Each portal presents a unique challenge, culminating in epic boss battles. The more you play, the stronger you become: level up, improve your skills, and dominate a world full of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/22aac0878e557043d2d4ee8f00c54977.avif?t=1743815931\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/501077fbf83ca031d31d88e2a1b640fa.poster.avif?t=1743815931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/501077fbf83ca031d31d88e2a1b640fa.webm?t=1743815931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/501077fbf83ca031d31d88e2a1b640fa.mp4?t=1743815931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fans of <strong>leveling</strong>, <strong>crafting</strong>, and screen-shaking attacks, <strong>SYSTEMCRASH92</strong> combines fast-paced gameplay with a fun style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/3be6bc2b92222bb4b86868ca280c0187.poster.avif?t=1743815931\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/3be6bc2b92222bb4b86868ca280c0187.webm?t=1743815931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411880/extras/3be6bc2b92222bb4b86868ca280c0187.mp4?t=1743815931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for action? Dare to clear the portals and prove your power!</p>",
